      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">1. Service Description</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">SmallEstateForm.com ("the Service," "we," "us," or "our") provides an online document generation platform that assists individuals in creating state-specific estate documents, including Small Estate Affidavits, Affidavits of Heirship, and Transfer on Death Deeds. Documents are generated based on information you provide and current state law as of the date of generation.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">By accessing or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use the Service.</p>

      <!-- 2. Not Legal Advice -->
      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">2. Not Legal Advice</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">The Service is designed to help you prepare documents based on information you provide. It does not constitute legal advice, legal representation, or the practice of law. We make no representations as to the legal sufficiency, accuracy, or applicability of any document generated by the Service for your particular purpose or jurisdiction.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Estate laws vary by state, county, and individual circumstance. Laws also change over time. You are solely responsible for verifying that any document generated meets current legal requirements in your jurisdiction before filing or presenting it.</p>

      <!-- 3. User Responsibilities -->
      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">By using the Service, you agree to:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#3C3C3E;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Provide accurate, complete, and truthful information when generating documents.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Use documents generated by the Service only for lawful purposes.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Verify all information in generated documents before signing, notarizing, or filing.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Consult a licensed attorney when you are uncertain about whether a document is appropriate for your situation.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Not misrepresent the content of any generated document or use any document to deceive courts, financial institutions, or other parties.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Comply with all applicable laws regarding the execution, notarization, and filing of legal documents.</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- 4. Fees & Payment -->
      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">4. Fees &amp; Payment</h2>
