      <!-- 7. Governing Law -->
      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">7. Governing Law</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising under or in connection with these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts located in Delaware.</p>

      <!-- 8. Modifications -->
      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;color:#1C1C1E;">8. Modifications to These Terms</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be posted to this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the Service after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <!-- 9. Contact -->
